sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant C as React or Flutter Customer
    participant Y as YARP
    participant D as Delivery API
    participant DB as Delivery DB
    participant R as Delivery outbox relay
    participant B as RabbitMQ
    U->>C: Enter delivery details
    C->>Y: POST /api/v1/quotes (EstimateFee)
    Y->>D: JWT and QuoteInput
    D->>D: Validate Customer and input, calculate versioned fee
    alt Invalid input or unauthorized quote request
        D-->>C: 400 / 401 / 403, no quote or parcel
    else Valid quote request
    D->>DB: Store owner-bound 10 minute quote
    D-->>C: 200 quoteId total expiresAt
    C-->>U: Preview fee
    alt Customer declines
        U-->>C: Cancel preview
        Note over C,DB: No parcel or delivery event
    else Customer confirms
        C->>Y: POST /api/v1/parcels (CreateParcel) + Idempotency-Key
        Y->>D: quoteId and acceptTotal
        D->>DB: Atomic unique principal/operation/key reservation
        alt Same key different fingerprint / expired quote / unauthorized
            D-->>C: 409 / 401 / 403, rollback
        else Duplicate committed same-key request
            DB-->>D: Original response
            D-->>C: Original 201 and parcel
        else First valid confirmation
            D->>DB: One transaction: consume quote, parcel Created, price, history, outbox, response
            DB-->>D: Commit
            D-->>C: 201 parcel tracking version and Location
            R->>DB: Read pending StatusChanged
            R->>B: Publish with stable eventId, await confirmation
            R->>DB: Mark sent after confirmation
            Note over R,B: Broker outage leaves row pending, duplicate publish is possible
        end
    end
    end
